 Math                                                                                                                   
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━                                               
                                                                                                                        
 Inline math sits on the line: $E = mc^2$, and $\alpha \times \beta$, and                                               
 the subscripted $a_{ij}$ beside the flat $a_{bc}$ that Unicode cannot                                                  
 lower.                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
 Scripts that exist are raised: $x^{n+1}$. Scripts that do not are                                                      
 written flat: $x^q$.                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
 Structures are linearised inline: $\frac{a}{b}$, $\sqrt{x}$, and                                                       
 $\sum_{i=1}^{n} i$.                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                        
 Display math is not laid out yet:                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
 $$ \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a} $$                                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
 Currency is not math: it costs $5 and $10 in total.
